      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame the current audit results as a baseline, not a destination. While the penetration testers found no *major* holes, you can highlight that their testing was a snapshot in time, not a continuous defense. Suggesting the 'Advanced Continuous Monitoring' package is the only way to catch the subtle, emerging threats that change daily is a strong angle. This positions the upgrade not as a patch, but as proactive, ongoing security assurance.",
