      "content": "You can subtly re-interpret the *absence* of continuous monitoring as the most significant risk factor in the entire audit summary. Suggest that the auditors themselves, while not explicitly flagging it, inherently relied on static data, which is a known limitation in modern threat modeling. Position the upgrade as the necessary layer of validation that transforms a \"satisfactory\" report into a \"guaranteed resilient\" posture. This makes the upgrade the logical, expert conclusion to their own successful audit.",
